# Runtime data truth at the pinned commit (verified by reading MessagesInteractionModel.kt, MainActivity.kt and AndroidManifest.xml).
# MainActivity renders latestFirstThreads(sampleThreads); sampleThreads is hard-coded fixture data (Maya Patel / Team thread / Alex).
# The only real action is Intent.ACTION_SENDTO smsto:, which hands composition to another installed provider app.
# No SMS permission, default-SMS role request, receiver, service or provider supplies live conversations.
# These values hold for the pinned commit only; a different commit requires re-verification and RUNTIME_DATA_REVERIFIED_AT_COMMIT to match it.
